iners_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-jinshu-079-xielang-family"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-jinshu079-xie-003","subject_person_id":"2pg_br4_mcl_A","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"2pg_br4_mcl","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"蒙子修","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-079","source_id":"s-jinshu-079-xielang-family","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-079-xielang-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-079-xielang-family:p001","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/jinshu/079.json"}],"interpretation_note":"按具名原文及本段語境保存，不補生母、未名共同祖先或絕對排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"person_id":"2pg_br4_mcl","title":null,"surname":"王","ming":"濛","additional_names":["王蒙"],"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-075","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families","source_id":"s-jinshu-075-xunsong-families","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunxian-intro:p001","note":"本卷作王濛，卷79作王蒙，按王修字敬仁及同一交遊核同；仲祖據卷93傳首。原文蒙字不改，不合入琅邪王氏。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"zi":"仲祖","references":[{"title":"《晉書》卷93王濛傳首","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1548000","source_revision":1548000,"source_position":{"first_line":69,"last_line":69},"quote":"王濛，字仲祖","raw_context_quote":"　　王濛，字仲祖，哀靖皇后父也。曾祖黯，歷位尚書。祖佑，北軍中候。父訥，新淦令。濛少時放縱不羈，不為鄉曲所齒，晚節始克己勵行，有風流美譽，虛己應物，恕而後行，莫不敬愛焉。事諸母甚謹，奉祿資產常推厚居薄，喜慍不形於色，不修小潔，而以清約見稱。善隸書。美姿容，嘗覽鏡自照，稱其父字曰：「王文開生如此兒邪！」居貧，帽敗，自入市買之，嫗悅其貌，遺以新帽，時人以為達。與沛國劉惔齊名友善，惔常稱濛性至通，而自然有節，濛每云：「劉君知我，勝我自知。」時人以惔方荀奉倩，濛比袁曜卿，凡稱風流者，舉濛、惔為宗焉。","raw_context_quote_sha256":"21d30b25c2abc03dbe50995cb917307f31ab4914a006e32655eea4cd02c16a17","wikitext_sha256":"8fc7f8b8a8a5a33a18c016006082a49f92e418f8fba965e1068b3e4e2016ff7e","scope":"primary_parallel_context_identification","image_verified":false},{"title":"《晉書》卷93王濛二子","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1548000","source_revision":1548000,"source_position":{"first_line":73,"last_line":73},"quote":"有二子：修、蘊","raw_context_quote":"　　簡文帝之為會稽王也，嘗與孫綽商略諸風流人，綽言曰：「劉惔清蔚簡令，王濛溫潤恬和，桓溫高爽邁出。謝尚清易令達，而濛性和暢，能言理，辭簡而有會。」及簡文帝輔政，益貴幸之，與劉惔號為入室之賓。轉司徒左長史。晚求為東陽，不許。及濛病，乃恨不用之。濛聞之曰：「人言會稽王癡，竟癡也！」疾漸篤，於燈下轉麈尾視之，歎曰：「如此人曾不得四十也！」年三十九卒。臨殯，劉惔以犀杷麈尾置棺中，因慟絕久之。謝安亦常稱濛云：「王長史語甚不多，可謂有令音。」有二子：修、蘊。","raw_context_quote_sha256":"aab6edcdca8614c642828a1e84e1061e939f5be2eb13b958964a878167b4e2e2","wikitext_sha256":"8fc7f8b8a8a5a33a18c016006082a49f92e418f8fba965e1068b3e4e2016ff7e","scope":"primary_parallel_context_identification","image_verified":false},{"title":"《晉書》卷93王修傳首","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1548000","source_revision":1548000,"source_position":{"first_line":75,"last_line":75},"quote":"修字敬仁","raw_context_quote":"　　修字敬仁，小字苟子<ref>苟子　各本皆作「荀子」。斠注：世說文學作「苟子」。按：世說文學、賞譽、品藻稱「苟子」者六七見，無作「荀子」者。通志一六五亦作「苟子」，今據改。</ref>。明秀有美稱，善隸書，號曰流奕清舉。年十二，作《賢全論》。濛以示劉惔曰：「敬仁此論，便足以參微言。」起家著作郎、琅邪王文學，轉中軍司馬，未拜而卒，年二十四。臨終，歎曰：「無愧古人，年與之齊矣。」","raw_context_quote_sha256":"92d6ed347065c63d3da452c3c403b23af06e0c40cc42692456084feb30274b12","wikitext_sha256":"8fc7f8b8a8a5a33a18c016006082a49f92e418f8fba965e1068b3e4e2016ff7e","scope":"primary_parallel_context_identification","image_verified":false}],"quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/jinshu/075.json"},{"id":"name-jin077-f51-030","person_id":"2pg_br4_mcl","title":null,"surname":"王","ming":"蒙","additional_names"